  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Which of the following are the example of double salt?</p><p>(A)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>(B)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>(C)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>24</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>(D)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CN</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>KCN</mi></math></p><p>Choose the correct answer.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "894ip",
      "text": "A and C only",
